---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { NAV, SITE } from '../lib/site';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="Zero cookies and zero third-party tracking on itemizedapp.com, plus a clear summary of data flows in a self-hosted itemized instance."
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">Privacy</p>
      <h1>No tracking on this site. Your inventory stays on your server.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        A plain summary of what happens when you visit itemizedapp.com and when you run itemized at home.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>This website (itemizedapp.com)</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>No cookies:</strong> This site does not set tracking or advertising cookies.</li>
        <li><strong>No third-party analytics or ads:</strong> No external analytics scripts, pixels, or third-party font CDNs are loaded by your browser.</li>
        <li><strong>No personal data collection:</strong> Reading these pages requires no account and submits no personal information.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Your self-hosted itemized instance</h2>
      <p>
        When you run itemized on your own hardware, all products, locations, stock levels, expiration dates, and shopping lists are stored locally in your SQLite database file (<code>/data/itemized.db</code>). Itemized has no built-in telemetry or phone-home reporting.
      </p>
      <p>Outbound network requests occur only when you configure or trigger optional features:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>OpenFoodFacts barcode lookup:</strong> Triggered when you scan an unknown retail barcode to look up product metadata.</li>
        <li><strong>Optional AI/LLM normalization:</strong> Sent only to the provider you explicitly configure via <code>LLM_PROVIDER</code> (including a local Ollama endpoint on your own LAN).</li>
        <li><strong>Optional OIDC SSO:</strong> Communicates with the identity provider you configure via <code>OIDC_ISSUER</code>.</li>
        <li><strong>Optional Web Push notifications:</strong> Sends encrypted daily digest payloads directly to the browser push endpoint of devices you enroll in <strong>Settings -&gt; Notifications</strong> using standard VAPID keys, with no third-party push service account required.</li>
        <li><strong>Direct LAN printing:</strong> Sends print jobs only to the local network thermal or CUPS/AirPrint printer address you configure (Browser Print / PDF stays entirely local in your browser).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>The public live demo</h2>
      <p>
        The public demo at <a href={SITE.demo}>demo.itemizedapp.com</a> runs with <code>DEMO_MODE=true</code>, requires no sign-in, sandboxes outbound printer/OIDC/LLM calls, and resets its sample database automatically every hour. Do not enter personal or private information into the shared demo.
      </p>
      <p>
        For deployment and configuration details, see <a href={NAV.selfHost}>Self-Host Quick Start</a> and <a href={NAV.configuration}>Configuration</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
